  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This is something to think about in terms of storage ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "expansion. SRB provides virtualization of distributed ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "hierarchical storage. Can we interface SRB with ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fedora? Apparently, DSpace is pursuing this.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Date: 2005-11-16 10:03",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sender: payette",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Logged In: YES ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "user_id=128",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Also, rework temp store so its not embedded in LLStore. ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "This may have been handled already by Chris and maybe we",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "just have to remove the configuration of temp store from",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "fcfg and make sure it is not created.   This came out of",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "discussions with the SRB folks who are creating an alternate",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "SRB-based implementation of IFileSystem. As things standnow,",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "IFileSystem implementations are used by",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "FileSystemLowlevelStorage",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "which sets up storage locations for objects,",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "datastreams, and temp files. When a NFS file system or",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "the SRB is used, then we are in the inefficient",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "situation where temp files are passed over a network",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "connection. We really want a local temp store area for",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "the Fedora server.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Date: 2005-11-16 09:59",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sender: payette",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Logged In: YES ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "user_id=128",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Also, set up a server module pattern for",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "FileSystemLowlevelStorage.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Date: 2005-11-11 14:23",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sender: payette",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Logged In: YES ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "user_id=128",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "other areas of fedora functions need to iterate through ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "file system (e.g., ingest when prioritizing order of ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "bdef/bmech/object).  Figure out how to handle with SRB.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Date: 2005-11-11 14:21",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sender: payette",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Logged In: YES ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "user_id=128",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "make sure we come up with a way for Fedora rebuilder to ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "work with SRB.  Somehow, the SRB would have to be able to ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "provide list of files (with path locations)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Date: 2005-11-03 16:08",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sender: payette",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Logged In: YES ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "user_id=128",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have received code from Reagan Moore's group and we need",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "to work out issues, figure out how to configure to SRB,",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "test, and integrate with core Fedora release.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
